## Next Steps
- Investigate with the billing team (or Concord documentation) how logical zones and migrations are identified for Concord ZV2 Impact tables if they do not match ZMP.
- For historical audits of these specific projects, Concord MUST be used, as Mastermind cannot reconstruct their physical overbilling without ZMP target zone mappings.
